# The age release the household drive carries, so the holder can open the copy
# without downloading anything on the day (ADR-0073). Each one is checked
# against this line before it is copied to the drive's tools/, and again on
# every visit. The binaries themselves go in backups/household/tools/ on
# trinity, downloaded once from
# https://github.com/FiloSottile/age/releases/tag/v1.3.2
# (docs/runbooks/carry-the-household-copy.md §1).
